	(text "USB-C input, the Li-ion charger and battery, the power path and switch, the 3.3 V buck, and the V3V and BAT\nswitches PWR_EN controls.\n\nMain parts: U7 USB-C, UP1 TP4065B, P3 battery, D1 1N5819, Q5 SI2307, SW1, U8 SY8089AAC, Q4 Q6 SI2301, Q7\nPMBT3904, LED1"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 68.58 0)
		(effects
