	(text "The ESP32-S3-WROOM-1 with reset, boot key and the UART header, the TF card on the shared SPI bus, the\ntrackball's Hall sensors and key, and the LoRa module with its antenna.\n\nMain parts: U1 ESP32-S3-WROOM-1, S1, KEY1, P8, TF MP3T-F, UZ1-UZ4 AN48841B, T1, U0 HPD16A, XX2"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 100.33 0)
		(effects
