	(text "The ESP32-C3 that scans the keyboard, with its flash, crystal and UART header; the keyboard connector and\nits backlight switch; the LCD connector with its backlight driver; the touch connector.\n\nMain parts: U5 ESP32-C3, U3 W25Q32FVSS, U4 40 MHz, J1, JP1 keyboard, Q3 BSS138, P2 LCD, U9 AW9364DNR, P4\ntouch"
