	(text "The two GPS daughterboards LILYGO publishes for the T-Deck: the MIA-M10Q board (parts +100) and the L76K\nboard (parts +200), each with its backup cell, antenna connector and 5-pin connector.\n\nMain parts: U101 MIA-M10Q, J101 J201 MS412FE, J102 J202, J103 J203 IPEX, U201 L76K"
