	(text "Every part: its value as printed, what it is, its nets, whether it is fitted and where it is drawn. A\nreference on the drawing leads to its row, the row back to it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 267.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.75 1.75)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0769a91f-3fc6-5b49-92d7-2e6c19e90ece")
	)
	(text "How to read it"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "db73c6ba-3112-503e-bbd0-669223c48d3a")
	)
	(text "Click a box on the left to open its page. \"Contents\" and the page\nnumbers at the bottom right of every page lead back here and to each page.\n\nCyan lines are connections: wires and pin ends, all one width.\nA dot joins lines; a cross on a pin end means the pin is not connected.\nPins connect by net labels (the boxed names): pins whose labels carry\nthe same name are on one net, on any page.\n[3/C4] after a label: page 3 carries that net too, its label in zone C4\n(column 4, row C of the border). Click it to land on that label.\nNo [page/zone]: the net is on this page only.\nClick a part's reference to find its row in the parts list; the row's\npage/zone leads back. A part crossed out in red is not fitted (DNP).\nWhite: parts and their references. Grey: values, pin names, pin numbers.\nA dashed frame is a block of the circuit, titled at its top left.\nAn amber K3 marks a Kleidos addition or correction: it leads to its row below."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 45.085 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.75 1.75)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4f1d741e-d9ac-5836-84ca-0945776f875a")
	)
	(text "Notes"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 96.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8af41809-8bd1-5c8b-a2d0-bf041ebc1e10")
	)
	(text "Every part, pin and net of the T-Deck Plus mainboard and of its two GPS\ndaughterboards, with the values the vendor documents: connectivity\ndocumented from the vendor's public documentation, with Kleidos additions and\ncorrections listed on page 1 (LILYGO's T-Deck schematic of 2023-06-01 and\nits T-Deck-GPS V1.0 and T-Deck-L76K V1.0 sheets, cited in README.md and\nnetlist.yaml). Layout and symbols are this project's. No footprints, no PCB.\nValues are as the vendor prints them (100K%1, 1uF/6.3V). A value of NC\nmeans not fitted: those parts are marked DNP.\nDesignators are the vendor's. The GPS boards reuse the main board's, so\ntheirs are +100 (MIA-M10Q board) and +200 (L76K board), and their nets\ncarry M10_ and L76K_: no cable to the main board is published (what P8\ncarries to the GPS board: K3, K7, K8).\nNets the vendor left unnamed carry names of ours (U8_FB, PWR_GATE...).\nZones: columns 1-8 and rows A-F, 50 mm apart, printed in the border."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 100.505 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.75 1.75)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "79e224f4-0b51-5ebc-adb9-39585d5c1627")
	)
